				     Window(home).Property(Engage.Next.*) from its own service: the
				     slot label and when it is due in words ("Tonight 19:00"), both
				     in white; only the heading and its rule take the accent. The
				     episode line Engage also publishes is deliberately not shown:
				     a show's slot reads as the show's name alone (asked for on
				     12/10/2026, shipped in 0.18.1).
				     The skin reads and never computes.
				     Gated by engage_block_shown (setting, add-on installed, label
				     present). The block is one button, 9320: OK opens Engage's own
				     launcher menu. Reached by Right from the right edge button,
				     or straight from the last tile while that button is hidden;
				     Right again wraps to the first tile. Packs up one slot for
				     each of the three blocks above that is hidden (the slides
				     stack). 650 to 780 here is 830 to 960 on screen, 10 clear of
				     a corner bar on the bottom edge. -->
				<control type="group">
					<visible>$EXP[engage_block_shown]</visible>
